Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:08.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, you cleaned!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:08.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你打扫过了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:11.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at these floors! You did the windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:11.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧这地板  你还擦了窗户
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have been begging you for months! And you did, you cleaned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:14.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你提了好几个月  你真的打扫了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And nagging works!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来唠叨还是有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:19.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I didn't actually do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:19.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  事实上这不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no. Was I cleaning in my sleep again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是吧  我又梦游打扫了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:25.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:25.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  也不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Well, then, who?  I got a maid. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么是谁  我请了一个女佣  耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:33.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope by "maid" you mean "mistress"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:33.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望你所说的"女佣"是指"情妇"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because if some other woman was cleaning...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为如果有其他女人在打扫咱家房子的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, honey, I know you don't like to relinquish control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  我知道你不喜欢让出控制权
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:42.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Relinquish" is just a fancy word for "lose."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:42.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"让出"就是"失去"的委婉说法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's really nice, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她人真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she mentioned that she adored the way you arranged the sponges.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还说她喜欢你摆放海绵的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did she really say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她真的那么说了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:54.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I distinctly remember because I thought it was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:54.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我记得很清楚  因为我以为她在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:57.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, just give her a chance, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:57.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给她一个机会  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:00:59.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:00:59.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我办得到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:03.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:03.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:06.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Usually when I'm this anxious, I clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:06.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通常我一焦虑就会打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:13.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E07 The One With The Stain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:13.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第7集  墨水印
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.93,0:01:53.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whose cell phone is that? It's just so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.93,0:01:53.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谁的手机在响  吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.11,0:01:53.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everywhere you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.11,0:01:53.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走到哪里都会发生这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.93,0:01:55.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's coming from your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.93,0:01:55.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想声音是从你的包包里传出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:00.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I never get calls!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:00.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从来没有人会打电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.02,0:02:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.02,0:02:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, it's Eric, from the Halloween party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  我是万圣节派对上的艾力克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.26,0:02:10.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ursula's fiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.26,0:02:10.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}厄休拉的未婚夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, Eric, hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  艾力克  嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, how'd you get this number?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下  你怎么知道我的电话号码
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:17.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a friend who's a cop, and he got it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:17.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个警察朋友  他帮我查到的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.27,0:02:21.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow. What an incredible violation and wonderful surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.27,0:02:21.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这严重侵犯了我的权利  但却让人又惊又喜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I just... I thought you should know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:26.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I broke up with Ursula.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:26.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟厄休拉分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:28.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you did? He did it, he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:28.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗  他办到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What did he do?  I'm talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他做了什么  我在讲电话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I was wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之我很好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.62,0:02:39.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if you were the sort of person who eats lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.62,0:02:39.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你平时吃不吃午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:42.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you asking me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:42.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是在约我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:44.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because it'd be kind of weird
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:44.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为那样会很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:46.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}since you just broke up with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:46.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚刚才跟我姐姐分手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:51.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, okay. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:51.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:52.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Bye.  No, no. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:52.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见  不  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.47,0:02:55.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was just saying that so you'd think I was a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.47,0:02:55.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我那么说是希望你觉得我是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:58.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fight for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:58.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}努力争取我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I won't take "no" for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会轻易接受你的拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:05.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not great, but we can work on it at lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:05.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然表现不太好  但我们可以边吃午餐边练习
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:09.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can be at your apartment in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以在两小时内赶到你家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:12.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great. How do you know where I live?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:12.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了  你怎么知道我住在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got friends too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:16.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Okay, bye.  Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:16.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  再见  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:19.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, I'm going out with Eric!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:19.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  我要跟艾力克约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:22.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This day is really gonna be so much better
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:22.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天比我想像中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}than I thought it was gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还要美好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:26.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Ross, I can't make lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:26.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  我没办法跟你吃午餐了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So apparently I'm available for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很明显我午餐时间有空
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:36.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't. I'm busy. I'm apartment hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:36.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  我很忙  我在找房子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:37.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:37.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要搬家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:40.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't live with Joey once the baby comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:40.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}孩子生下来后我不可能跟乔伊一起住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:43.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want my child's first words to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:43.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不希望我的孩子会说的第一句话是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"How you doing?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"你好吗"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:48.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So does Joey know you're moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:48.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊知道你要搬家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:51.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I haven't discussed it with him, but I know he'll be relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:51.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还没有跟他谈  但我知道他会觉得如释重负
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:54.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Last week, he brought this girl over,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:54.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上星期他带了一个女孩回家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:57.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I talked to her about morning sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:57.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟她谈晨吐的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I showed her pictures from my pregnancy book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还把我怀孕纪念册的照片拿给她看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} That's not really porn?  Not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}内容不会很色情吧  不太会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:06.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? If you're looking for a place,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:06.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然你在找房子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just heard in the elevator this morning
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今早我在电梯里听说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:10.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that a woman in my building died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:10.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我住的公寓里有个女住户过世了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.13,0:04:13.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Was she old?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.13,0:04:13.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  她年纪很老了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does she have a view?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的公寓景观好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:18.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, but how great would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:18.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  但那样一定会很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:20.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You living in my building?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:20.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你搬到我的公寓里来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:24.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could take care of the baby, I could come over whenever I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:24.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以照顾宝宝  想过去就过去...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:26.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:26.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然得先得到你的允许
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:30.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That really would be great. Well, can we see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:30.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就太好了  我们能去看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们不该那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:34.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, if she just died this morning out of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:34.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毕竟她今天早上才过世
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. No. No, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Shall we?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:43.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们去吧  好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:53.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:53.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. I'm Ross Geller. I live in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:56.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  我是罗斯·盖勒  住在这栋公寓里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:05:00.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm Rachel, an admirer of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:05:00.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是瑞秋  我很喜欢这栋公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:05.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I heard about Mrs. Verhoeven passing away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:05.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听说佛哈芬太太过世了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:08.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I am so sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:08.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:10.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} She didn't pass away.  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:10.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没有过世  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:12.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mother's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:12.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈妈还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:14.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:14.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:18.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It looked like we were gonna lose her this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:18.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她今天早上差点就过世了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:21.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but she's a tough old bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:21.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她是个意志力很强的老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:23.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you close with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:23.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟她很熟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:28.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course. She and I would talk all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:28.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  我们常常
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:31.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in the laundry room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:31.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在洗衣间聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:33.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You speak Dutch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:33.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会说荷兰语吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm very honored to meet a friend of my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很荣幸见到我母亲的朋友（荷兰语）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I would, but it's just too painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会说  但说起来只会让我伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So she's really not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她真的没死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. She's hanging in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  她还在坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:57.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you tell me, is she hanging in in a onebedroom or a two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:57.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能告诉我她是在一房还是两房里坚持吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:05.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mrs. Bing, this tile cleaner is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:05.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宾太太  这个清洁剂太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:06.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:06.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在哪里买的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:09.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, well... I make it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:09.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我自制的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's two parts ammonia and one part lemon juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两份的氨水加一份的柠檬汁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:14.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The secret ingredient is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:14.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}秘方是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? We just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗  我们才刚刚认识
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:22.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. I'm gonna go get the clothes from the laundry room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:22.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我去洗衣间拿衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.93,0:06:26.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I come back, I'll clean behind the refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.93,0:06:26.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我回来后会打扫冰箱后面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.31,0:06:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be back in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.31,0:06:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:36.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:36.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧  我告诉过你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:38.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She stole my jeans!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:38.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她偷了我的牛仔裤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:42.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:42.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:46.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been looking for them all week, and she is wearing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:46.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我找了一个星期  她正穿在身上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:47.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So she stole your pants
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:47.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以她偷了你的裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:50.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and then came back and wore them in front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:50.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后当着你的面穿在身上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you see? It's the perfect crime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不明白吗  这是完美犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:57.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She must have been planning this for years!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:57.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她一定计划了好几年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:06:59.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll prove it to you, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:06:59.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会证明给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About a week ago I was wearing those jeans
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几周前  我穿着那条牛仔裤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I dropped a pen in my lap,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把钢笔掉在大腿上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it left an ink stain on the crotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在裆部留下了墨水印子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When she comes back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她回来后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:08.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will find it and show you that stain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:08.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就让你看看那个墨水印子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:14.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, isn't it possible the company that sold the jeans
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:14.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  卖那条牛仔裤的公司
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:16.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}made more than just the one pair?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:16.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道只做了一条牛仔裤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.51,0:07:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.51,0:07:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说得有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:21.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So should't we give her the benefit of the doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:21.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该先找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}before we go snooping around her crotch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再去看她的裆部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. I'm just glad I didn't give her my secret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  幸好我没告诉她我的秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:33.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Out of curiosity, what is your secret ingredient?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:33.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很好奇你的秘方是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:34.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:34.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想得美
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come in. I'm so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请进  我很高兴你能过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:45.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:45.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not in the shaky, angry way that you are, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不像你那么震惊愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry. I just saw Ursula.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  我刚刚见过厄休拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to get the engagement ring back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得把订婚戒指拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:56.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just seeing her brought it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:56.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到她  让我想起了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All the lies, the way she used me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些谎言  还有她是怎么利用我的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:04.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I get so angry, just looking at her...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:04.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}光是看到她  我就觉得好生气...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Face.  Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说看到她的脸  对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. It's just, when I look at you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  我看到你的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就像是看到了她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:22.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And when I see her,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:22.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到她时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:25.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I get a little bit angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:25.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就会觉得很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:30.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Maybe this is too weird.  Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:30.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样太奇怪了  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:34.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's only a problem when I look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:34.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有我看着你的时候才会觉得生气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.31,0:08:37.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.31,0:08:37.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.07,0:08:41.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, don't tear out your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.07,0:08:41.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  别把你的眼睛挖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:44.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was just gonna take out my lenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:44.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是要把隐形眼镜摘掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:46.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. Try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:46.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:50.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So is that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:50.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那样子好多了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:52.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:52.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:59.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're blurry, but you still look like Ursula.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:59.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看起来很模糊  还是很像厄休拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.57,0:09:00.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're "Blursula."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.57,0:09:00.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是"模糊的厄休拉"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, wait. Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  等一下  也许
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I just don't look at you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我暂时不看你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:16.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? It works. I'm not angry at all anymore.
