Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:27.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is just to give you an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:27.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是做一下大致构想
