Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:31.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以在这里装拉帘  给宝宝留有隐私
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:34.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and maybe a mobile over the crib...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:34.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在摇篮上面装个音乐铃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and here's a baby monitor
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:36.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是宝宝监控器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which, till the baby comes, we can use as walkietalkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝宝没出生前  我们可以把它当对讲机
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的是太体贴了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:48.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! And you gave the baby Hugsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:48.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  你帮宝宝买了企鹅宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:58.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's really just to show where the baby would go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:58.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是要向你示范宝宝该躺在哪里
