Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:01.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快把它交给我吧  免得你误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:09.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, the baby is gonna be crying. It's gonna be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:09.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  宝宝会哭的  那会非常地吵
