Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道我不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about all the women you wanna bring home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你带回家的姑娘们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:22.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look. If I'm bringing home a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:22.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我把一个姑娘带回家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:24.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}who can't stand being around a baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她连和宝宝相处都做不到
